Package: canopytocohort
Title: Canopy to Cohort Research Workflow
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: person(
    "Dinesh", "Potla",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "29446671+dineshpotla@users.noreply.github.com"
  )
Description: Reproducible analysis of recorded sugar maple sapling recruitment
    and linked sapling fates in Michigan northern hardwood Forest Inventory and
    Analysis observations. Includes audited sampling continuity, benchmark models,
    county-held-out validation, full-refit bootstrap uncertainty, county maps,
    and reproducible research reports.
